Package: zola
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Kaysarjan Kasim <ceaser.k.w@outlook.com>
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), libiosexec1
Description: Zola Codex provider manager for jailbroken iOS
 Zola manages Codex providers, writes Codex configuration, and runs a local
 proxy for model aliasing and Responses/Chat Completions compatibility.
